<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Dear&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName},</span></font><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div><div><font face="arial">I hope that you are enjoying your summer break and getting ready to begin the fall semester on Aug. 18, 2016. We look forward to seeing you&nbsp;</font><span style="font-size: 12pt;">at </span><a href="https://havasu.asu.edu/" style="font-size: 12pt;">ASU Colleges at Lake Havasu City</a><span style="font-size: 12pt;">.&nbsp;</span></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Due to your exceptional academic profile and pursuit of a science-related degree program, you have been awarded a ${xxxx} <b>Martha Bennett Memorial Scholarship</b>. This scholarship is made possible through the generosity of Mr. Dean Barlow, who contributed funds in memory of the late Martha Bennett. Bennett was a well-known Food and Drug Administration consultant from Lake Havasu City, who believed in the importance of higher education and the sciences.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">You will see your scholarship posted in your <a href="https://asu.my.salesforce.com/email/author/my.asu.edu">My ASU</a>.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Go Devils!</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">David A. Young</font></div><div><font face="arial">Director</font></div><div><font face="arial">ASU Colleges at Lake Havasu City</font></div></div><div><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>